          <h3>Pre-listing inspection</h3>
          <p>Same scope as the full residential inspection, priced the same, timed to help sellers fix things before offers arrive. Comes with a seller-facing summary that separates "must fix" from "disclose as-is" so you know where to spend.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="alpine-report-field">
