          <p>Before your builder's one-year warranty expires, we inspect for settling cracks, HVAC commissioning issues, plumbing fixture drift, and workmanship that's come loose. Report formatted for easy submission to the builder's warranty desk.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="alpine-report-field">
          <strong>When to book</strong>
          Two months before your 1-year warranty anniversary. Leaves time for the builder to respond without rushing you.
