<section class="alpine-section alpine-section--cream-deep" id="sewer-scope">
  <div class="alpine-container">
    <div class="alpine-sentinel"><strong>§ 02</strong>Specialty &amp; add-on</div>
    <div class="alpine-services-grid">
      <article class="alpine-service">
        <span class="alpine-service-label">§ 02.01 &middot; Sewer scope</span>
        <h3>Sewer-line camera inspection</h3>
        <p>HD camera run from the cleanout through the main to the city tap. Detects bellied lines, offset joints, root intrusion, and collapsed clay pipe — all big-ticket repairs nobody wants to find at move-in.</p>
        <ul class="alpine-service-list">
          <li>Standalone: $225</li>
          <li>Bundled with inspection: $175</li>
          <li>HD video + written narrative</li>
          <li>Chain-of-custody for insurance claims</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="alpine-service" id="radon">
        <span class="alpine-service-label">§ 02.02 &middot; Radon</span>
        <h3>Radon 48-hour test</h3>
        <p>EPA-protocol continuous radon monitor placed for a full 48 hours with chain-of-custody. Colorado is in the EPA's highest-risk zone; mitigation is cheap, regret is expensive.</p>
        <ul class="alpine-service-list">
          <li>Standalone: $185</li>
          <li>Bundled with inspection: $140</li>
          <li>Lab-grade continuous monitor</li>
          <li>EPA protocol compliant</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="alpine-service" id="infrared">
        <span class="alpine-service-label">§ 02.03 &middot; Infrared</span>
        <h3>Infrared / thermal scan</h3>
        <p>FLIR thermal imaging of the envelope, mechanical systems, and any suspicious wet areas. Finds insulation voids, plumbing leaks hidden behind walls, and electrical components running hot.</p>
        <ul class="alpine-service-list">
          <li>Standalone: $150</li>
          <li>Bundled with inspection: $95</li>
          <li>Thermal images in report</li>
          <li>Effective in Colorado seasonal extremes</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="alpine-service">
        <span class="alpine-service-label">§ 02.04 &middot; Water quality</span>
        <h3>Water quality testing</h3>
        <p>Lab-processed water testing for wells and municipal supply. Bacteria, nitrates, lead, arsenic, heavy metals, hardness, pH. Required by some lenders on well-water properties.</p>
        <ul class="alpine-service-list">
          <li>Standard panel: $195</li>
          <li>Extended panel: $285</li>
          <li>Certified lab results</li>
          <li>Chain-of-custody included</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

